{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48dbd521fece83d18c444d6f206fadfc7867c7058b8c48869107b7790d6ab22b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ce89806573cb24de3f996803fe878444be7e26477427c571a2e074482365b77",
      "text": "像自己，像我们自己",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a83cbac4e0f6baf974c7017deef4aa25341b763eb4f3a8f3481ad6a517f4664d",
      "text": "获得了参加名为《大扫除解决队》的电视节目\n出演试镜机会的Legenders。\n然而，未能取得十分满意结果的3人\n重新确认起组合的魅力……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ce89806573cb24de3f996803fe878444be7e26477427c571a2e074482365b77",
      "text": "像自己，像我们自己",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e1a2e0f61eb73a7aabb2f2610bdc261ea0d0bf544da5577d9e259aeecde5ab",
      "text": "早上好～……啊，抱歉。\n正在开会中吗～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:850d449cf4ad3fde4133826f7e4f73f40523e39761eb64d321fd7ea29228a72d",
      "text": "早上好，想乐先生。\n还有，Legenders的各位也到齐了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e86572b7a38c96c32909c01c8c9b7e0a08086c7dbe8d468da87d83f862dda4ea",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，早上好。\n……哎呀？旁边那位是。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fdf6b166bcb994a9e34de7c2c6516620e9caffceb16005deb6f7cc0b49431b",
      "text": "这位是协助W制作视频的\n导播先生。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adebacb60a87749a34449c571d2f15effe44e3c7b2b3a88068d416e74a27fc77",
      "text": "啊啊，就是前阵子的“24小时颠球”吗。\n听说评价相当高呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b1b8b2ef336d35ec097e9a1dd8e61ff228d6d57a97eb821c70e17c7e4f76e1",
      "text": "是的。所以刚才正和导播先生一起，\n构思下次的视频企划。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f9c243c0ea1d3bdc87257a5b929bd272b954ff0d51711150a969bf1afc9a821",
      "text": "想乘着这股势头，\n大张旗鼓地宣传我们嘛，",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:070aafe90ae5b6c035a3a92dd99fdbe714ea5a0d4487af0aec67c0601998e4ce",
      "text": "大家把各自的点子拿出来，\n聊得可起劲了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59502cec6a8deed94bfa766436070fa9798634c0d01631ab56ce2920a7651cd7",
      "text": "比如模仿漫画里的必杀技射门啦，\n或者去给粉丝们当足球教练啦♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afbb51b06bfeb70025d60520d78f861050f21f728201a2cf2c3a6d87a0b33e17",
      "text": "听起来都很有趣呢！……哎呀，\nW的两位，差不多到下一个预定安排的时间了哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbb50c49c79a872d3d1e61d4bce6eaca12684545bc988c080556d909c34efbf0",
      "text": "OK！●●●●●●●●●●监督，后面就交给你啦。\n悠介，剩下的在路上边走边想吧♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a93c070b39eef31b5756b7b82989c33c8c61b8aaa71281c7835a9c5d658e4c53",
      "text": "言语交锋处，可见意气扬。\n两个人都干劲十足呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d25362639608877104bd8f4ed47fbab84440bb5b7efc4c00b8a88e57b8781ff",
      "text": "是的。托他们的福，315频道的观众也\n明显增加了很多。但是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdbf5b970077d2c9aa9cc6dc57b0cc9690550bafdd6f10de070e4bbe501f7ab1",
      "text": "想要参加JIF，还需要更高的认知度才行。\n比如，在热门电视节目中出演……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aee0193767af09f0d586c5e41c02e297a9af29f55ebdd44e94b69bda614001f",
      "text": "～♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf1dc8ac05ddef1ac7ac5c12846388c8c92b9ef71df0c4370b78ed21e4adb41",
      "text": "好的！接下来是《大扫除解决队》板块！\n在这个板块中……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9f38c673ce060a239ccf2d492b1f90e6115c9be20fc709d114f4776e69730e",
      "text": "清洁节目吗……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7cb584ff494a4450a39d3d966b3dea84a273599726fd98c5b9ee980f46cf064",
      "text": "嗯。似乎是由队员们用绝技来解决\n观众关于清扫的烦恼呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4323786679e08f496a54085c71696076d28c577fec40f2f3513750c18871e5c",
      "text": "哇，这可真是顽固的污渍！\n遇到这种情况，只要用这个就没问题啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0355b81a792a365e76ff9a4500a7c48e336d248e83be520dbdbf50c8e855f9d",
      "text": "还挺能干的嘛……\n换作我的话，这里应该……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a044d54e5c2d620a0c8b35e4152f02a8a62969b01adcdb9858c3a3b8a403450d",
      "text": "（雨彦先生看节目看得入迷了呢。由偶像负责的\n大扫除节目吗……真是再合适不过的工作了）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5fb30efbf5b14c2b85e69a7d2f7ef19b56caa7ef944c2a2bfb8844e0aff284d",
      "text": "哎呀。\n莫非，你对打扫很有兴趣吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb97daad27a5e19118cf2a26acb50d991d7f95d11f70c20782948545ec2ba466",
      "text": "是啊，我以前原本就是做保洁员的。\n一听到“污渍”，总会在意得不行。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426100bd7976746455e99bffdda8ebd6188fdc77671fccfdae80dd991d2c1dfc",
      "text": "曾经是保洁员的偶像吗！\n原来如此……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9749d7f543b99873b627c633913ad2d63da091d63568807e3379236b8cde16fd",
      "text": "其实在这之后，我原本打算去见见这个节目的\n制作人。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:764df7b5ff39cb7295cf07d0e2de3c0ec40f2364bd072fd779390a2fdda833f2",
      "text": "这也算是某种缘分，我去稍微打听一下吧。\n要是有什么进展，我再联系你们。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4c50f70fda10a55657d6084e8c846f9bce0386ea2ce6d4bc68d5376d038c3b4",
      "text": "真的吗！非常感谢。\n那就拜托您了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02c266c4f477ec014d82f87067e248184ff8b40785a9be92cf1c6a5b1facf1df",
      "text": "……虽然有些突然，\n但要是能借此连接到机会就好了呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:276ba1ef1ddf553494607de26bb440ee16f28764fed59c7293184ba78ab1f335",
      "text": "是的。如果我们真的能上电视的话……\n光是想象一下，心跳就加速了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b07f474520a59cbd52305934892b103aaa5083ec5e4b1630da310dab00ddb5e5",
      "text": "好啦，各位。为了有缘分敲门的时候能抓住，\n我们也差不多该去努力训练和工作了吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2",
      "text": "摄影棚",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b39dce6fbaa8b7509f066389a6c17e3a682b16283d5d700f475c9071b726f54a",
      "text": "（拍摄很顺利。大家好像也渐渐习惯了\n工作……哎呀，来电话了）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef7c0bfbf4be6e43dcabcf566eafd64f4598e5385b05b163254dcbaca981c08e",
      "text": "……好的，真的吗！非常感谢！\n……得立刻去转告大家才行！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000054:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b778da12e44b043eb3a21bef897722f6e5014accfaf2495bacec6def645c7bcf",
      "text": "拍摄结束后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b386cce40e11b9b3e15ac46abf266afcfe1fd0778a65e363122500953c69f74",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，怎么了吗～？\n总觉得你看起来很高兴呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2a42ecd6b1b27a8d387481e58672d7fbe7191abe5180c2ff8231693253dcc27",
      "text": "其实是《大扫除解决队》的成员临时\n出现了空缺……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d5949ab7962d95274e4ad8cde0362f9f8d6d138c49c5dcaf7e43376198a683a",
      "text": "选拔代打人员的试镜，\n好像明天就要举行了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51380da4e06da9a30c7183dc38df697eeda4c84841ce28ceda90610681a8fe27",
      "text": "于是……对方联络说，\n如果可以的话3位要不要也来参加！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15bfbf56a136e10cd8928a6ece803348102b0db6798f3e9f8bfe8dcbf31a0396",
      "text": "试镜……那可真是求之不得的好事啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:185ef88598040bf2e0042322b57e1f87f1eff53a77e4d6e33262a614c0e93e27",
      "text": "虽然定在明天确实太仓促了点，\n但即便如此，也没有拒绝的理由对吧～？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:789ddcda10519afb5836f713ce3d1cc8d14a0e06c6bd2cb09c7a973054f80a24",
      "text": "怎么可能会拒绝呢！\n这对于315 Production来说……最重要的是，",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_c:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ca6efa1bdddee1440b7857a785ebfa95741388c745758b56f2436884fd8db99",
      "text": "对于我们Legenders来说，是一个巨大的机会！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:011cadf85564751c11cb244f7072e83d120eef2a16bc5cae05d50a49cf0256d1",
      "text": "（今后要继续靠偶像这份工作糊口的话，\n这种知名节目还是想出演一下的呢～）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c4696bfff31aa2b67de98eb19ae453e4eb75108887238ffabb9b42a80e2f1d",
      "text": "（这正是打扫演艺界污垢的好机会啊）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d42b1443ce03c170deb0290f7039ba4772dbe6c3bdf36b671272cf705757f31",
      "text": "（如果在电视上介绍大海的魅力，\n说不定同好就会变多呢……！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ccdb320b9587b296a9542e42805f8a36106ce03f299808e5576b5bcb04a34fb",
      "text": "想要通过试镜的壁垒虽然很高，\n但只要齐心协力一起努力吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd8205028a2d69ecee84732ff6df07792f36bcff25360141848addedcb35668",
      "text": "……正如克里斯先生所言，\n门槛好像挺高的呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2660165df1b5154db397ac9f0e28c790fc904f23a2ac6fac75a480aec1a89a6b",
      "text": "那个，●●●●プロデューサー。这次的\n试镜，我们该做些什么才好呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd27e0ea7b5734b6f22c1aa0cc5db54766fa71d1e8edcc9d140f022514cfccb1",
      "text": "展现出各位每个人所拥有的“自我风格”\n固然很重要，不过……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdabf33d4193a5395eba7aacdaab9755a5c1c73a92fcb73db80d7a1b5b91d428",
      "text": "毕竟是刚结成不久的组合，让对方了解到\n“组合的魅力”也是非常重要的呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dd4c7788b34bd3a21863344141c5b7831e59f2675ef67a005872e61baee7cca",
      "text": "考虑到节目的主旨，\n只要展现出雨彦的清扫技巧应该就没问题了吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8578d092915cbe638d5b345d909bd79b093a917591c23a5367571d35bca0d7ad",
      "text": "哈哈，要是那种事的话就交给我吧。\n要是能在现场演示打扫那就最好了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82c11d6a6ecd1271661737415cb8b5dee377bd8dfc1a845563df7a7969c4f405",
      "text": "（……组合的魅力吗～\n制作人也真会出难题呢～）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000140:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000152:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:528e2bf8a2e122da1c00778d5b9b71a8eb2cfed673fc0f52114a702953015faf",
      "text": "是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n我是东云。现在方便耽误一点点时间吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000154:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aad4db1b126725eea08b3c31cb1a2ca80473a5a55d61bcbe85f8a061a6019a1",
      "text": "其实，我听说Legenders的各位要去参加\n《大扫除解决队》的试镜了……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000156:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf7c64617b063519f93c78b5aa9679b733fd6d905c43aff92bc24be2d38e999",
      "text": "莫非是来加油助威的吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000158:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53e7985015d319f44e228dcfdda2420ea4b036901c84d5dd9daf18cd6ea1ada2",
      "text": "是的，没错。……说起来，其实我\n经常会收看那个板块。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000160:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0211a22aed66a3a8f484ee20bab334d7afbdbb95c7e55dd0f4aa72edb5905395",
      "text": "节目经常会播出一些\n对我们咖啡厅清扫很有帮助的信息哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000162:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b3cd5410529ddf32bfcc4c81d44ac8eba99351208a7fbe71cc8056938b58b21",
      "text": "比如擦除顽固污渍的绝技，还有缩短打扫时间的\n诀窍等等，都非常有参考价值。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000164:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87bd2a807570eb7228685d13b802d2296cc168919851b75e8b01ea5fa17d3fa",
      "text": "就在刚才，我还在制作新款蛋糕。\n结果因为太集中于操作，厨房就……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000166:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:088b2dbe831ff0f0a7119a8643e7e1dcbfae27b3ae696f0258806cdc4bb194ac",
      "text": "看来，正好可以试试之前节目里教过的\n新绝技了呢。呵呵。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000168:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7189d321294be77e9263a2682e334d43ecf39b03af364512fc1e0608b92edc3",
      "text": "那么，我差不多该着手开始打扫了。\n请替我向大家转达一声加油。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000170:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ab07a9553f40bd33822cdcb0caa8a5fa50f47a06aceee2fa01bbc70e3c4e8a",
      "text": "也请转告他们，要是合格了我绝对会看节目的。\n……那么，我就先挂了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2af4c9f217bccd1f1b99c1a590dc7eaf6266085b6d8ace27a6c112d06b64747",
      "text": "哟，●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n方便聊聊吗？有件事想跟你说说。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7deb1e18dd04fafee608d2a203cceabc1c1038defe9279cbb8e16996732c8b7b",
      "text": "其实，我听到风声说Legenders要去参加\n《大扫除解决队》的试镜了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1782402ce6bfcda6035445e491f3162473574e4e097dd35f4a50657172ca3ca5",
      "text": "那个节目，意外地有很多派得上用场的情报啊。\n所以我也经常在看……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b67b96b7819a2f558e1701e9d139b4256432c4b24a5f9aa46f8c9e00bdb31e48",
      "text": "特别是关于衣物清洗的信息，\n我每次都不会错过。前阵子也是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a97ff0bb69d3ceb85255a3968a511d72f37ae3eca7aeedd6ede366611412ac90",
      "text": "……哎呀，糟糕。洗衣服的话题先打住，\n今天我还有别的事必须要传达。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000036:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30045c12bfb2b5d1c35520e7396a3158d140c2ca92171280234909818ec07ee6",
      "text": "莫非\n玄武先生也是来加油助威的？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34675d61a3dc883a203e7aa1c032ff50ad23c47d6baa7fa9b5e4d3b308f3265b",
      "text": "“也”，这么说的话……难道说，\n除我之外还有别人打电话来加油了吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000040:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde08024f4fbafb43dd33f163c929a6107002b9f3b501b959f7015e68a69d637",
      "text": "……哈哈，原来如此。\n庄一郎大哥也打电话来了啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000042:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08b2b31abd476608de9799d13bcc75374d70d15237a258c470e96e758bb3db1a",
      "text": "怎么说呢，真不错啊，咱们事务所。\n聚集了一群真正热血的同伴啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000044:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b82a8313216728fa74a07ffbc8d07bd8b16b20332c08e2d73c83a7a79030c1b",
      "text": "那么，我差不多挂了。要是合格了的话，\n我绝对会看的。给你们加油啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000060:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eca5bbb1fa78d35aa198d3e81e0dba68b9083054421ede6d539e7ce9a5b7d45",
      "text": "试镜会场",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aa8a7852285816ec28bbbf318b08ae6b89e7760842b6901efd8d8a0e86e9d8f",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀，欢迎你们来！我看看，\n是“Legenders”啊……嗯嗯，原来如此。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0202ce58c58b3bfe0f37e842304ec6cdffb1236ec80c49f11a3419019012505c",
      "text": "那么事不宜迟就开始提问吧。首先是你！\n简历上写着“前保洁员”对吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da5b57ff25fcff79b175646352f5bc0286fbf5ce9c8d3e2eedb7139a032de76c",
      "text": "是的。我想在这次的节目里，\n也能活用这份经验。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c40cf3190e4612067540ba8c6ebf6d88f57edb1dca93e4f8b5f98820722eee15",
      "text": "我之前隶属于一家叫妖怪保洁社的地方。\n以前也曾因为清扫委托来过这栋楼。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa500a838426e08b50eda9a6fadd5a7d272a5d223eb1a3c0ab123008ae44d88f",
      "text": "竟然在那家业内无人不知的保洁公司待过吗。\n原来如此。葛之叶君，我看你相当有两把刷子啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0beb91b9255759858dfa46f44600c9bde717ed496d58407f2ca3c45267a888e",
      "text": "那么接下来，旁边的你！\n有什么关于打扫的小故事吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e49724703df1a961d0fa50df388e29860b09a0ac216bc816e769a73a049412ff",
      "text": "好的，这个嘛……关于打扫方面，\n我自认有着普通人水准的注意与留心。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf46b8d125718ed3ebdfed109d3a85e393014721d8d8a18cfefb119e8b94266",
      "text": "嗯嗯，普通人水准啊。\n那么，旁边的你呢？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c8e6cf1c1d5d0dcc1a85d8d2fafffcd7e361a225746fe00a2726a7f32115d7f",
      "text": "我也差不多是这样～不过，\n平时雨彦先生都会教我各种各样的诀窍～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc2fb132b9fc736276d8a11ff5250528ba0bb1418a100bb2381c651216ba44f8",
      "text": "看来葛之叶君的清扫技术，那是相当\n了不得啊！原来如此，不妨来详细聊聊吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f970aed1595d7e4ee6196228542a07f2610232254e32c9bea842d4868a0ddf7c",
      "text": "好的……比如前几天节目中提到的\n污渍种类那一期……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3ebd20c6fc4ab5b03fe83aab395744ab334448778fe134d63f9d93aae17e291",
      "text": "嗯嗯，完全听懂了！\n那么，试镜就到这里！谢谢各位！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_e:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:670eab96acff0ab1cfaaa032a42b4f11b1cae4f1630540cfdda3e66dcae33fe7",
      "text": "……啊，制作人君。你能稍微留一下\n吗？我有点事想跟你聊聊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c3ee6b490a69fc2c3960fd0801a683ebae2cfcf20b9b698bc89c844c90206e",
      "text": "呼……总算结束了试镜。\n果然，对雨彦的反应很不错呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb8f85c289f823ee6702803489a9dd0a070b1d28b034d962d354d7038d7536c8",
      "text": "……怎么了，北村。\n一脸无精打采的样子，是在担心结果吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2faebc282e4184e5f32c3da05d9119a573eb93cc4b36e5aeae2418272413a98",
      "text": "所忧之事，何止一端。……虽然结果也\n很让人挂心，但我总觉得这样真的好吗～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f80ac469f1e118f1c5e57b3ed95aaa6d6b34a4c31b8d6cff02784bdc8a40faa",
      "text": "“传达出组合的魅力和自己的风格很\n重要”，制作人之前是这么说的吧～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a15a7e4e92b5b0acd0e5303d21a6f4f08d30513f4d7d50485adba97f05c547",
      "text": "确实，雨彦先生的魅力我觉得传达到了……\n但反过来说，也仅限于此了吧～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21ed84f20b717235eff1e9cb1b791523b849c63ae019f4a377785bb551a34d44",
      "text": "说实话，我觉得并没有传达出作为组合的魅力，\n感觉……并没有非要录用我们3个人的理由呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a5d30a52173eb7610fd02c1fb0a5d628cba6951388498cee897089e07fd3a2b",
      "text": "抱歉啊，把你留下来。\n那么，关于试镜的感想……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5503cc65a0c78b6c4d6ac1cfdf9a4dc8535e9a9be7afe76afde7dab83870a48f",
      "text": "葛之叶君，他很出色！\n清扫技巧似乎也无可挑剔。……但是。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a73d8a589f1d646740e32d3deb4ee96192434b3285f5db25abef258929f623c2",
      "text": "北村想乐先生，古论克里斯先生。\n这两个人的详情也很令人在意对吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf7dbcc94ef5f79eb421f53ecbaefa71b74798211262fe599c9ff664e8e9e15c",
      "text": "就是说啊！我这个节目的观众，\n可不仅仅是看清扫技巧……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:446b378e19325ddef8c7d3ec7d9c0b0e107c4d23751a6c800617d85c09452d97",
      "text": "对出演偶像的人品性格，\n也是很有兴趣的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52ad325bc7b7844850b0ed500ce72817868113ea632f1e889994b5a904e38895",
      "text": "所以，希望你能再多跟我讲讲。\n他们是怎样的人，这又是怎样一个组合！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000006:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec82fea3cf02a92fd5a9006e83f86f1aac7331f3bc09736900487505b975657d",
      "text": "（如果能在这里把Legenders的魅力传达出去，\n说不定就能争取到上节目的机会！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000008:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae20d21247fba7d01bdc7c54014a71395ae24eda4e5f0e055bfadd1efcb2b859",
      "text": "好的，请允许我重新向您介绍！\n首先是Legenders的成员古论克里斯先生。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1d73e4f96aa99151976203fafab68659aa8afd9502eb71b1bb24b4154794256",
      "text": "他在成为偶像之前，原本是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b76c05362666f2073985106da355fbf3d6034d36d6bb0ca4545fc3940522cda9",
      "text": "海洋学家",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79666eb5ecd7db7f225c379a149533ec6d417b5a23997fc8fc4f0e03ec125fcf",
      "text": "天文学家",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3819b29771b85c8276361d810c969216d5eec29fbd1a0a07f855414404bac30c",
      "text": "哦哦，是这样吗！那想必，\n海洋方面的知识一定很丰富吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a7888a147d2aaad14c29913f82074e074f7e77895f0e48947eeca14273341b6",
      "text": "哦哦，是这样吗！那想必，\n宇宙方面的知识一定很丰富吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6dee21901f829c834e1a689a90df0fd449d58f7d8b55bdac786fe1aca989210",
      "text": "（咦？真的是这样来着吗……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fac3210a4ae63c3b1ee5a7aef4f79d71debc17d86d02062f0f06314d8cc7dbcd",
      "text": "那么，另外2个人呢？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed549fea9588cc7a09ad2bbeac402ab8db976e8e1e4e270c8a66b290d5911fde",
      "text": "接下来是北村想乐先生。\n他很擅长以某种形式来表达事物。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:831c1e443790f04beaf7451a0871c64bb347f490dcce245aa17e0d460cf9e64a",
      "text": "川柳",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d077ff031a21b3cf75c76c73b953690f6765031f127b226e3aea8b7aca0891c6",
      "text": "俳句",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8106c7c494d116e94f6bd45b1d74305d99fc0a0f4987d06a30cd5ca06dd8a31a",
      "text": "ほう，年纪轻轻真让人钦佩啊！\n下次真想让他即兴作上一句呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8106c7c494d116e94f6bd45b1d74305d99fc0a0f4987d06a30cd5ca06dd8a31a",
      "text": "ほう，年纪轻轻真让人钦佩啊！\n下次真想让他即兴作上一句呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6dee21901f829c834e1a689a90df0fd449d58f7d8b55bdac786fe1aca989210",
      "text": "（咦？真的是这样来着吗……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cd8fdc94414c757b75a3261b2a0532f0cbe68c8be1b71fae95a5e8ad344fe62",
      "text": "……那么，剩下1个人的特征，\n能准确地告诉我吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eec06a7c3968aeb58a9d1515a477aa9853c8c833b841764563e5c578a63768f",
      "text": "好的！葛之叶雨彦先生的身高，居然有……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000044:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f21529589e118dda4f44d9ce650a19d892d0292d16a9c0bec34bd4b02aac187a",
      "text": "191cm",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000045:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e5d2e4282dc20e304e2be65f283fc03c69090893c1dd3bc556816cab785a473",
      "text": "199cm",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eaca1a1e08a442965ed556bf6b58164e364c1ab6c0af1b0d701472525543dfa",
      "text": "那可真厉害！\n确实，当时我也觉得他个头相当高呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6539a9928a8a7a1907c6e40c17a0439d6b55f447e406302edfd15e8ecde42e14",
      "text": "那可真厉害！……不过，让人担心镜头能不能装得下啊！\n能再告诉我一次他们的魅力吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81ff34426cab57470758929eecdd8feb18209159c2b9549f2078bd7aaa2c5c44",
      "text": "（看来是弄错了。好，重来一次……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bb438adb883887eaa1d612b5cc9aaa4bd99d7ecb6e85a470511553edcda330e",
      "text": "原来如此……\n关于他们的事情，我稍微有点了解了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d76319363291c3607762380d8e722a77d7a56a12ba9b92d78bd36876a37f2da4",
      "text": "非常感谢！那么最后，\n所谓Legenders这个组合的魅力就是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ca2ae1b6f865e519cfd0689c2a0f933bcf632968bc3c1c761202fe852d230bb",
      "text": "……哎呀，抱歉，好像来消息了～\n……悠介君？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6250c50d292165a8b6ca33aac15cf91f90fea64a549617b23300e69d1743ad81",
      "text": "呵呵，问我们试镜进展如何呢～\n看来一直在替我们担心呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59f3dd7f5f0bab8fe7e55a933adf9a165e57514d8d157caef95723cfebcff1c7",
      "text": "……来得正好。\n关于组合的魅力，比如W……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be76b4d36a9fe4c4ee808e9fdacbcc6b6db33a4bff60c0c6f9cb00ce49ac1e86",
      "text": "不仅互相了解对方的长处，也理解彼此的缺点。\n他们被如此坚固的羁绊紧紧相连。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c678a56ec091ed01b9992a46c4eae63edefdcf56a3bc56d62ab58c6f946ff4d",
      "text": "比起自己更重视对方的兄弟关系，\n正是那个组合的长处吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c3bb74ec92f3afc507dd939039bf69f239b9a8a72ff9a0f37a9770e2f7b1edc",
      "text": "可是，我们又不是家人，年龄也各不相同。\n也找不出什么共同点呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89beec6638cbab28878075de6bb3128fce66842e3d6aa33da81e3ac26e3c09be",
      "text": "倒不如说，大概，我……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a73068c9ff49328751fe6ede8cbc0302dfc3ad865dfafea9f2d05895dda43aa4",
      "text": "今后也不会为了顾虑雨彦先生或克里斯先生\n去迎合迁就的吧～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0b527e126e52908bd4f971347ac4007dd113bf7cd3b4f3cb3daaf73e1614413",
      "text": "哈哈。这可是彼此彼此啊。\n我也绝不会勉强自己忍耐着和你们待在一起的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6505f5f0ea6ac69ee444faaf1cc1cb03ccee1452daeed9a4bec5e848933a3ecc",
      "text": "是啊。我也不擅长迎合他人，\n和两位在一起反而很轻松。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:603518b27a42e67c1947bb13243ecad8263492a2d6ac5a16427ca982a95433c4",
      "text": "是啊。但我认为那样就好。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35fc528b176e95b5c35bc0767cb5d08532709d35688622be5aee976e9ef42267",
      "text": "我们每个人，应该都是抱着“不能退让的目的”\n才成为偶像的吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a3d7cd7788ae97c2ca49e2d68dc2da17771f09ad4f3df27bd7bc6218f46f67",
      "text": "为此，时而自由行动，时而互相协作。\n所谓Legenders这个组合，不正是如此吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68d9b25755a92d9588d5bb0974c4e27c0482a374e7c2356505f39dac6cc25bbd",
      "text": "没错！而且我们，\n也都在尊重着彼此的能力。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e384715a4b3d4b157e78a1e2f8c52a2b0fd3d41ad63e8930b9716e7fcc5a37c5",
      "text": "既然如此……面对像这次这样的状况，\n清扫领域交给雨彦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d095ab8a59d57ff330689f66e1d5f295ba44d87671b5b72864bde100e58d97e",
      "text": "我和想乐，只要在其他的领域\n去展现力量就好了也说不定呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36ace5adc96f2a884bef2222232f8a9236b7f36a7e9094f6d1223b4fa5a3ce92",
      "text": "这样啊～……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c4f15a8d5daffff3c81e6f5a4d4f436ced4ed6e216ff41b13f3e9781177aa9e",
      "text": "（光顾着去应付试镜本身，\n都忘了自己成为偶像的目的了呢～……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:861035182802ae454d8b925b31b5993258d425ad5a1e10e3829ba294720f47a1",
      "text": "要是能展现出更多属于我们自己的优点……\n说不定就能上节目了呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d16ba29f66ee3613629e86a500a05dfc194b40af61311f0d1039ccc3b2a3f600",
      "text": "让各位久等了！关于结果……\n恭喜各位！合格了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194",
      "text": "……哎？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000198:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000207:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9c5909b5fdddf3013bee71c8bddc6f112b2f49fd8e395d2a176b98672b637d9",
      "text": "制作人，\n今天的试镜，\n多方面感谢你了～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000209:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:456d780228f24f056d539fa6bdd167aeca9267598ac6376df14fc9440068d03e",
      "text": "在我们离开之后，\n你替我们打圆场了吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000211:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d35d78f6b75e9b4b61fe5fa836a4ceb89ec1620a7e392d2b19c6754ce8efa639",
      "text": "都是多亏了\n各位的实力！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000214:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df316ce28b5859526bb474c33c6ca3a579dfbfe6f69dfe6b185bd04451406b0a",
      "text": "听你这么说固然高兴，\n但这绝少不了你的功劳。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000216:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0453a4fc676d1771266a520de4c341bac6f572d9349867f170c00606cca6ae7e",
      "text": "我也是同样的看法。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000218:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7af0647fc94c51448c0db073a83792d035adaa300768698a87853f80c52bb10f",
      "text": "很遗憾，我在那个场合\n未能传达出组合的魅力\n与自己的风格。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000220:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece2bcb156563a899dbf69d3d0db03c287c501744a0376c17748d23fb18253ea",
      "text": "但正因如此，\n我想在正式录制时努力大显身手。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000222:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bedfa09ccf5194c73e6c8aad910e44cee6cb469c7faf545e63c8f59f4c99824",
      "text": "我也会，把这身打扫手艺\n发挥得淋漓尽致的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000224:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54e4e48fe845801a5e3ba1f4103703ee392a29227b69909a8e283ceba0ce3058",
      "text": "很期待各位的表现！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000227:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6028a2b5110b0f23175f0940b2655815bd428a8c442964bd7d64d0c7883ad248",
      "text": "谢啦。\n那么，正式录制也拜托你了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000229:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1b6d37732d351699e3081dfaf1866822c56c8a9d8b32b25dd14353ac1d3b0a9",
      "text": "我也会为了正式录制，\n好好调整并做好准备。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_h:cmd-000231:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab6644c54437542a396281a8c3a20acf3eb264fcc7d38ec714b3919b095a0e8b",
      "text": "辛苦啦～\n正式录制，一起加油吧～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a88c1155e6944d94147dbba041a7da479e4aa0b3e5c1f53a218b534d53accf9",
      "text": "喂——大家——。《大扫除解决队》的板块，\n马上就要开始了哦——",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce1db13a5e0741b719af4b83bd092c7a67171be8dd3683cefbc3f08387b39b1e",
      "text": "Legenders的3个人，不知道紧不紧张啊～\n话说回来，怎么感觉我也紧张起来了……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da54e3082b4f4ebf41ca147381031967e31b76a731eb27c7bb8cc43e1ea5d5f",
      "text": "不是，又不是悠介你要出场！\n不过嘛，能合格真的太好了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e59487250feeba1fe820b8a868b09f2d2b1556f879494f284201dcfc4d64a336",
      "text": "雨彦先生很期待今天的出演呢。\n说是要在电视上展示前保洁员的手艺。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68e55c45b4fcb984c800d4ad1419398b8920fe9f4e814ba50e5b6945ac8c9be",
      "text": "啊——，搞得我也想上电视了！\n下次跟监督……哎呀，光顾着说话时间到了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6be35a096d4c95b34da6f98bd3b4d447e4ba80e3ac9c44e936e40c6fca606f7",
      "text": "克里斯先生，表情好僵硬……在紧张吗？\n和平时一样就没问题了哦～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6cde0c0eade3441d80b0874251654c770998cd91dc75f94cb177b3b8de66dd",
      "text": "啊啊。前阵子不是说过了吗？\n只要别忘了展现出我们的本色就好，对吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd468f5d8103f488c894f13f674087e89a7b7b31af9bed8bc2c6c414fb76d8a4",
      "text": "你们两位……也是呢。\n重要的是，不要忘记展现出自己的风格。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:049b84cc0d44ee13f39d28e59ca31cb93cb6da128cc46cdb1699dad6b8313268",
      "text": "是这样对吧，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b8ffa222b890d916b64c1b0c103e9bcdab128eda497d7aa6175670dfa9c24b",
      "text": "嗯！只要保持自然的状态，就完全没问题。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e69628da36334a2d62a28e88b350553bfd852ad227f1541a90c71b25f87f78b",
      "text": "各位只要保持最本真的姿态，就有着最棒的魅力！\n……好，请出发吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_i:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d24ef33e3ef742103a07a86170db37c136bf1b0ee72fa805c53a8d00cfece5a9",
      "text": "好～的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63fa67a3f61ddcdfe60c4cdfb00020f9b89fa9195cf96b6b07d64a74e2611200",
      "text": "污垢与烦恼通通一扫而空！\n大扫除解决队～！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd73b1df37ad27506c8fc00c8f12940a9540b5aaddbaceb536ddf7ff5e5efb6",
      "text": "今天要清扫的房间，就是这里……\n这可真是，乱得惊人的客厅呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03a33de5c8ee313b074180ba5a3fc342a008c51a6543b84a282286a450956067",
      "text": "相当有打扫的价值啊。好，北村和\n古论，把地上的行李挪开。我想清出立足点。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bce146c488a2e30af33410be2c1d882ae7fb0f6cb1bac6f313c3bb3650d78dec",
      "text": "知道了～细致的打扫就交给雨彦先生，\n我来做我能做到的事吧～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:687b3a5c43cc6c6068c06437a181a9d35641b41e8322c1ecf0b6c235bfd5f361",
      "text": "话说回来，还真是够过分的啊。瞧，\n因为根本没好好擦过窗户，都成了霉菌的温床了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85a15fa63384fb06de0b2c6c081e72bfe6cc1ab790d5b7d79ac9bb1aff720366",
      "text": "确、确实是一副惨不忍睹的模样。\n但雨彦……再怎么说，是不是说得稍微有点过分了？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe7e61e7c1bc05b19ebd4385d4fec94add09567acee24681337cde9b75b4361b",
      "text": "ほう……那既然这样，那个也能放着不管吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21d88c6a54ab0e9e938cc171c15d57f18b24aba6be2ccf5bd4b766b18b495fd3",
      "text": "瞧瞧吧。古论最喜欢的鱼，\n被埋在杂物堆里遭大罪了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66afd0684e63e86a32e5cae3a588a886aa620e6693cfe4224783835c9ea10ac2",
      "text": "这、这是……公子小丑鱼的玩偶！\n啊啊，怎么会遭遇这种惨事……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d952dab98241552a529d2892c4ee8d1474c49e032ad475a66962fbdeb12ca224",
      "text": "虽说在海水鱼中算是比较强健的，\n但它们本来的栖息地可是海葵啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9962b889aaba21b4675519f59f1749f63688a9eaa447d386cbedf0db42d172",
      "text": "让它待在如此受到污染的环境中\n实在令人心痛……必须立刻施救才行！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34b278aacb167d4bc179c5e0cde031591a33a43a6fe2a1646ba4fc2edf90d951",
      "text": "（呵，节目制作人也笑出来了啊。\n他们两个，看来也找回平时的步调了）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edb99533f644967410dc5862d4344bc74f2727a0f0f997559c7f7ceb9c690ba9",
      "text": "好，那么接下来，去打扫天花板。\n北村、古论，准备好了吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_j:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1328858b72076382b4434a1d60241e572fa393e0e21d8022ddd6bd6bcd0ca477",
      "text": "请交给我们吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
